      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I'm goin' in after hittin' this ganja",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Out to dinner with the homies, private table at Nakama",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I'm a new millennium Sinatra",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Coppin' marijuana from the neighborhood Rastas",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Chiefin', feastin', king of the new school",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"I'm speakin' in tongues, try translatin' voodoo",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Hold up, let me start again",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Undefeated shirt, Levi's and a Mister Rogers cardigan",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"It's a hell of a feelin' bein' this fresh",
          "rhyme":"aS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Spit seem to sit upon my lips, call it Blistex",
          "rhyme":"Eks",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Peddlin' this medical, the presence of a general",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Magazine centerfolds, they all up on my genitals",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Got the game in the palm of my hand, it's itchin'",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Wildin' out, better talk to your man, he bitchin'",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"'Cause I ain't got a lot time for these weirdos",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Talkin' shit all up in my earlobes",
          "rhyme":"Ob",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"I just live life, try and do it right",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"Everyone that hear me say, \"The boy is super nice\"",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"Put a bitch up on a flight, she gon' be here by tonight",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"Get some afternoon delight, only eat it if it's ripe",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"Call me Stanley Steemer, I be givin' her the pipe",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"And when I'm outta town she wanna see me so we Skype",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"She might get obsessed and keep callin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"Thirty-thousand feet, Tom Petty, free fallin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"Just layin' back, lettin' gravity take its course",
          "rhyme":"uRs",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"I wanna tell all of my haters that we made it, boy",
          "rhyme":"Oj",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"26",
          "text":"From basement studios to some official shit",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"27",
          "text":"From stressed out all the time to \"I don't give a shit\"",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"28",
          "text":"Used to dream about it, boy, now I'm livin' it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"29",
          "text":"412, it's the Most Dope syndicate",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"30",
          "text":"Had a normal life but now I'm sick of it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"31",
          "text":"Try and spend money just to spend and it's ridiculous",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"32",
          "text":"Young and so mischievous",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
